   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **The Balrog (Live in Barcelona '25)** (1 other source): The set included teases for Forty Six & 2 and Am I In Heaven? [2]\n- The source notes this track was played for the first time since an unspecified date [1]\n- This song was performed for the first time since August 16, 2023 [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Supreme Ascendency (Live in Barcelona '25)**: back after 90 archived shows (809 days); rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **You Can Be Your Silhouette (Live in Barcelona '25)**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2025-05-25.SBD.flac** (recommended): soundboard; 17 songs; 123 min [1]\n- **kglw2025-05-25.Spain2025N3**: source not stated; 17 songs; 123 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2025-05-25.SBD.flac**: taped by Sam Joseph, Joe Santarpia, Grace Reader, Gaspard De Meulemeester; source: SBD [1]\n- **kglw2025-05-25.Spain2025N3**: taped by Jamie Downsworth; transferred by Tora Tapes; source: Sony PCM D50 [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Wear It Loud Tee: [Official King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard 5-25-2025 Poble Espanyol in Barcelona Spain Poster Shirt, hoodie, sweater, l](https://wearitloudtee.com/product/official-king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-5-25-2025-poble-espanyol-in-barcelona-spain-poster-shirt/) [4]",
